{
  "name": "31 · Vigilante de deploys de Vercel",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 31 · Vigilante de Vercel\n\n1. Crea un token en vercel.com → Account Settings → Tokens.\n2. Credencial Header Auth: nombre \"Authorization\", valor \"Bearer TU_TOKEN\".\n3. Si usas un equipo, añade ?teamId=... a la URL.\n4. Configura el canal de Slack y la hoja de Google Sheets.\n\nRevisa cada 15 minutos los últimos 20 deploys.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 260
      },
      "id": "nodo_111",
      "name": "Nota de configuración",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 15
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "nodo_112",
      "name": "Cada 15 minutos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://api.vercel.com/v6/deployments",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        },
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "limit",
              "value": "20"
            }
          ]
        },
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth"
      },
      "id": "nodo_113",
      "name": "Consultar deploys de Vercel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        340
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "Vercel (Authorization: Bearer)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const cuerpo = $input.first().json || {};\nconst lista = cuerpo.deployments || [];\nconst VENTANA_MS = 1000 * 60 * 30; // solo deploys de la última media hora\nconst ahora = Date.now();\nconst fallidos = lista\n  .filter(function (d) {\n    const estado = d.state || d.readyState || '';\n    return estado === 'ERROR' && ahora - (d.createdAt || 0) < VENTANA_MS;\n  })\n  .map(function (d) {\n    return {\n      proyecto: d.name || 'sin-nombre',\n      url: d.url || '',\n      creado: d.createdAt ? new Date(d.createdAt).toISOString() : ''\n    };\n  });\nconst salida = {\n  api_ok: Array.isArray(cuerpo.deployments),\n  hay_fallos: fallidos.length > 0,\n  total_revisados: lista.length,\n  total_fallidos: fallidos.length,\n  detalle_fallidos: fallidos.map(function (f) { return f.proyecto + ' (' + f.url + ')'; }).join(' | '),\n  revisado_en: new Date().toISOString()\n};\nreturn [ { json: salida } ];"
      },
      "id": "nodo_114",
      "name": "Evaluar deploys",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond_014",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.api_ok }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo_115",
      "name": "¿Respuesta de API válida?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        660,
